Why not make the castle wand (0:3), all randomly generated ones (0:1)
[or 0:random if you want], and have wands of wishing disintegrate when
you charge them or use them down to (0:0) as a special case.  It'd
require more code, but it'd appear more elegant to the player, I
think.

